# SDD governance

This repository is governed by a constitution and an operating manual. Cursor reads
`AGENTS.md` natively; the two files below are the source of truth and outrank anything a
tool file could say. This file only points at them — it deliberately restates none of
their rules, so there is one copy to keep current.

- `constitution.md` — the binding principles (C1–C9). If an instruction conflicts with it,
  stop and say so.
- `AGENTS.md` — the operating manual: the phases and their `prompts/` bodies, the
  non-negotiables, the provenance rules, the human checkpoints, `sdd.config.yml`, and what
  `node scripts/spec-lint.mjs` does and does not enforce.

Read both before acting. Do not summarize them here.
